<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύσᾰνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tassel</i>: mostly in pl., <i>tassels, fringe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>), of the <i>tassels of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				2.448
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώνῃ ἑκατὸν θυσάνοις ἀραρυίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.181
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.189
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τῆς ὀθόνης θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				5.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλος ἄχρι τῶν θ. πεποικιλμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					18.222c
				</span></i>
			; of the <i>tufts</i> of the golden fleece, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.231
			</span></i>; of the <i>long arms</i> of the cuttle fish, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.178
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικτυωτὸς θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.26
			</span></i>. (Possibly connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύσσομαι,
				θύω</span>.)</div>
